      "name": "dsh-noagent-schedule",
      "title": {
        "en": "Noagent Schedule",
        "zh": "零 Token 定时调度"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Run shell scripts on a schedule inside DeepSeek Harness with no model call and no token cost. Cron or interval, per-job time zones, timeout, overlap skip, readable logs, a settings page and agent tools. wakeOnChange wakes a session only when the script output changes.",
        "zh": "在 DeepSeek Harness 宿主内按 cron/间隔跑脚本，不唤醒模型、零 token。支持每任务时区、超时、防重叠、可读日志、设置页与 agent 工具；wakeOnChange 让脚本输出有变化时才唤醒会话。"
      },
